\pard\b\fs20 Cold Skies\b0\par
\fs16\par
The Cold Skies are magical lands the clonks travel to in order to become mighty mages.\par
As usual, they kill each other wherever they meet, to prove that they themselves are the best.\par
Every clonk starts with a simple igloo and tries to use the deadly lightning to his advantage.\par
Build a magic tower, search for treasure and kill everyone else.\par
Little by little, building material, treasures and scrolls appear in the magic snow, and you can make them yours by digging them out.\par
